>
> This is a hard one to learn.

Agreed.  Some clarity:
Wands of fire are perfect Elbereth tools (one turn, permanent).
Lightning does the same but blinds you.
Wands of digging are pretty good at E as well, and that can be a better
use than digging down depending on circumstances.

